  "method": "Official EDC Las Vegas 2026 festival map: a cartoon of the Las Vegas Motor Speedway drawn top-down, rotated so the oval's long axis (NE) points up, with the infield heavily enlarged relative to the track. Tied the drawn speedway ring (centre of the band, measured on the plate) to the OSM raceway centreline, pairing points by normalised angle around each oval and using OSM nodes, plus fixed infield features: the service-road junctions and road-course bend that the art draws as Kinetic Trail, Rainbow Road, Power Path, Daisy Lane, Memory Lane and Electric Avenue, and the Neon Garage (drawn as the rainbow ring: courtyard centre and the four diagonal outer-wall faces). Art pixels were read on zoomed grids and OSM points from node ids; no stage, tent, gate or other temporary structure was used. Ring points at 41, 54, 141, 257 and 270 deg sit under labels or light-pink stretches and were placed on the fitted ring outline.",
